OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters take on US challenge
OL,4,Ain 9/11 tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters from Herefordshire and
OL,7,FShropshire are among hundreds heading
OL,8,Fto the US for a stair climb challenge
OL,9,Fmarking the 25th anniversary of the
OL,10,F9/11 attacks.
OL,12,FBecky Barden, based in Prestigne,
OL,13,FLeominster-based Beth Jones, and Kat
OL,14,FFrost, Stuart Hughes, Andrew Bradbury,
OL,15,FSimon Roberts and Luke Alexander from
OL,16,FShropshire are all travelling to
OL,17,FGeorgia for the Atlanta Stair Climb on
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
