OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters take on US challenge
OL,4,Ain 9/11 tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,200 firefighters from
OL,7,Faround the world will take part to
OL,8,Fhonour the US firefighters who died in
OL,9,Fthe World Trade Centre attacks and
OL,10,Ftheir aftermath.
OL,12,FThey will climb 110 floors - the same
OL,13,Fnumber of floors as the Twin Towers -
OL,14,Fwearing full firefighting PPE.
